  "body": "Currently, state transition to the \"closed\" state is done by\n- setting up a fulfill callback to [[closedPromise]] in the constructor\n- resolving [[closedPromise]] in [[doClose]]\n\nWith this method, the state transition happens via two microtasks. This change\nreduces it to just one microtask. This is required for #192 to work.\n\nThis change also cleans up unnecessary fields in the write record.\n",
